ty\nMaxx HD\nBolero Pik-up\nBolero Camper\nABOUT\nABOUT\nAbout us\nPress Releases\nStories\nMedia kit\nCareers\nQMS Certificate\nOWNER\nOWNER\nService\nAdventure\nMerchandise & Gear - Eshop\nParts and accessories- Eshop\nCare & Maintenance\nOwners manual\nQMS Certificate\ncustomer service\ncustomer service\nContact us\nFAQs\nTalk to an expert\nDealer Locator\nCorporate Sales Enquiry\nSitemap\nSitemap\nQMS Certificate\nquick links\nquick links\nVehicle configurator\nTest Drive\nBook Online\nCalculators\nExchange\nFinance\nScrappage\nSubscribe a vehicle\nBecome a Dealer\nDownload the M4U app now!\nLets connect on Whatsapp\nChat now\nChat now\nMahindra Corporate\nTerms & Conditions\nOur Privacy Policy\nCopyright  2025 Mahindra & Mahindra Ltd", 'annotations': None}]}, {'url': 'https://ackodrive.com/car-guide/mahindra-xuv-3xo-features-explained/', 'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': '[visible] Mahindra XUV 3XO Features Explained: Your Complete Guide\nHome\n/\nArticles\n/\nCar Guide\n/\nMahindra XUV 3XO Features Explained: A Comprehensive Guide.\nMahindra XUV 3XO Features Explained: A Comprehensive Guide.\nPublished on 27 Aug, 2024, 9:41 AM IST\nUpdated on 28 Aug, 2024, 5:59 AM IST\nTeam Ackodrive\n8 min read\nInteresting Articles\nFollow us on\nShare Post\nMahindra recently launched the much-awaited Mahindra XUV 3XO as a compact SUV in the Indian automotive industry. Outperforming its rivals, the Tata Nexon, Hyundai Venue and Maruti Suzuki Brezza, the Mahindra XUV 3XO brings a fresh look to the segment.\nWith the latest updates and comfortable features, the Mahindra XUV 3XO is on the list of must-buy compact SUVs in India. Here, we will take a closer look at the Mahindra XUV 3XO features explained and help you choose the ideal car.\nContents\nPrice of Mahindra XUV 3XO Variants\nAfter the\nMahindra XUV 3XO\nfeatures are explained, you must know the price of each variant. Hence, we have prepared a table for you highlighting the ex-showroom price of each XUV 3XO variant:\nMahindra XUV 3XO Variant\nEx-Showroom Price\nMX1\nRs. 7.49 Lakhs\nMX2\nRs. 9.99 Lakhs\nMX2 PRO\nRs. 8.99 Lakhs to Rs. 10.39 Lakhs\nMX3\nRs. 9.49 Lakhs to Rs. 11.68 Lakhs\nMX3 PRO\nRs. 9.99 Lakhs to Rs. 11.49 Lakhs\nAX5\nRs. 10.69 Lakhs to Rs. 12.88 Lakhs\nAX5 Luxury\nRs. 11.99 Lakhs to Rs. 13.49 Lakhs\nAX7\nRs. 12.49 Lakhs to Rs. 14.49 Lakhs\nAX7 Luxury\nRs. 13.99 Lakhs to Rs. 15.49 Lakhs\nNote\n: The prices of the Mahindra XUV 3XO variants can change without any prior notice. So, before booking your car, talk with your nearest dealer to know the latest price.\nCheck out:\nMahindra XUV 3XO Variants\nUnlatch Elated Driving Experience with the All New Mahindra XUV 3XO\nMaking its presence felt in the Indian compact SUV market, the Mahindra XUV 3XO is one of the best cars in this segment manufactured by Mahindra. It offers more convenience and comfort when driving on different terrains. The following are detailed discussions of the Mahindra XUV 3XO tech specs and features:\n1. Influencing Exterior Look\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XO has a specific design to turn heads with its athletic stance. It commands respect and exudes the confidence of a true SUV. The all-new Mahindra XUV 3XO has an ample ground clearance of 201 mm, making it easy for you to drive on rocky terrains. In addition, the XUV 3XO comes with a command seating position to offer an exhilarating driving experience.\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XO has LED DRLs and headlamps that will lead the road to envy you whenever you turn them on. Furthermore, the infinity tail lamps add an X factor to your style quotient. The car also features 17-inch diamond-cut\nalloy wheels\nfor that sporty look.\nCheck out:\nMahindra XUV 3XO Dimensions\n2.\nComforting Interior\nWhen you drive the Mahindra XUV 3XO, it elevates your every journey. Stepping inside the XUV 3XOs cabin will let you discover a sanctuary of sophistication and comfort. It is one of the key parts of the Mahindra XUV 3XO features explained, as it has a meticulous design for the finest SUV lovers.\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XO features a Skyroof and soft-touch leatherette on the door trims and dashboard. Furthermore, the car has premium leatherette seats, a cooled glovebox with illumination, and a passive keyless entry. It also features a front armrest with storage and a console with a cup holder for a comfortable drive.\nCheck out:\nMahindra XUV 3XO Interior\n3. Smart Connectivity\nAnother key Mahindra XUV 3XO configuration is its smart connectivity and technology. The car comes with a Harman Kardon 7-speaker audio system to make your drive enjoyable. In addition, the sound system lets you experience sonic expanse, and the bass enhancer technology uplifts your mood while driving in crowded areas.\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XO features a high-definition touchscreen system for infotainment and navigation and has built-in Amazon Alexa for entertainment. Moreover, with the ADRENOX Connect technology, you can control your cars features through your smartphone from the comfort of your home. It allows you to control more than 80 car features through a few taps on your smartphone.\n4. Caged Protection\nRegarding protection, the Mahindra XUV 3XO is one of the premium compact SUVs in India that comes with advanced level protection. The car comes with 35 standard safety features, ensuring all the occupants are safe inside this cocoon in case of a mishap. It has 4 disc brakes as standard to ensure you can stop easily if there is any mishap.\nIn addition, the Level 2 Advanced Driver Assistance System (\nADAS\n) offers a comprehensive package, promising paramount safety. The compact SUV also features traffic sign recognition, high beam assist, lane departure warning and smart pilot assist. With all these safety features, you and your loved ones are safe inside the Mahindra XUV 3XO in case of a mishap or to avoid such unforeseen situations.\n5.\nPowerful Engine\nWhen discussing the Mahindra XUV 3XO features explained, we must remember the engine specifications. It comes in three engine options: mStallion Turbo Charged Multipoint Fuel Injection (TCMPFi) engine, mStallion Turbo Charged Intercooled Gasoline Direct injection (TGDi) engine and Turbo Diesel with CRDe engine. All these three engines offer high performance without compromising on fuel efficiency.\nThese engines enable you to leave hesitation behind the acceleration and conquer different road conditions or terrains. Moreover, the 6-speed torque converter automatic transmission offers an optimised gear shift quality with low fuel consumption. It also enables you to switch effortlessly between the three drive modes: Zip, Zap and Zoom. In addition, the Mahindra XUV 3XO features the first-in-segment smart steering modes, which are standard for all variants for a comfortable yet powerful driving experience.\nCheck out:\nMahindra XUV 3XO Mileage\nKey Specifications of Mahindra XUV 3XO Variants\nAfter discussing the Mahindra XUV 3XO features explained, you must understand the key specifications of each Mahindra XUV 3XO variant:\n1. MX1\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XO MX1 has mStallion Turbo Charged Multipoint Fuel Injection engine type. It features a rear seat centre armrest, parking sensors, air conditioner, power windows-rear, accessory power outlet and AC vents. In addition, the variant features halogen tail lamps and a pole-type antenna.\n2.\nMX2\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XO MX2 variant features all the specifications of the MX1 variant. It also features a 10.25-inch infotainment system, 4 speakers, and steering audio control. You also get remote\nkeyless entry\nand a follow-me-home headlamp.\n3. MX2 PRO\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XO MX2 PRO variant features 6 airbags, an anti-lock braking system and central locking. You also get ISOFIX child seat mounts, hill assist, electronic brakeforce distribution and speed-sensing auto door lock. In addition, the variant offers a single-pane sunroof and wheel cover.\n4. MX3\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XO MX3 variant features 10.25-inch HD infotainment, wireless Android Auto, and wired Apple Carplay. It also has cruise control and a wireless charger. Moreover, the variant features a power-adjustable exterior rearview mirror and LED tail lights.\n5. MX3 PRO\nThe MX3 PRO is the upper variant of the Mahindra XUV 3XO MX3 and has all the features of the previous variant. In addition, it has Bi-LED projector headlamps and LED DRL with front turn indicators. It also features an infinity LED tail lamp and a stylised vector wheel.\n6. AX5\nThe AX5 variant of the Mahindra XUV 3XO features twin HD 10.25-inch infotainment screens, a 10.25-inch digital cluster screen, and Adrenox Connect with built-in Alexa. It also has 16-inch diamond-cut alloy wheels and passive keyless entry. Moreover, the variant features a rear armrest with a cup holder, auto headlamps, and an auto wiper.\n7. AX5 Luxury\nWhen you buy the Mahindra XUV 3XO AX5 Luxury variant, you get a Level 2 ADAS and a 360-degree surround view system with a blind view monitor. It also has an auto-dimming', 'annotations': None}]}, {'url': 'https://www.spinny.com/blog/mahindra-xuv-3xo-price-specifiations-images/', 'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': "[visible] Mahindra XUV 3XO: Price, Specifications, Images\nSkip to content\nHOME\nNEWS\nRULES & REGULATIONS\nBEST CARS\nBUYING A CAR\nGUIDES\nCAR COMPARISONS\nCAR REVIEWS\nLOANS\nDOCUMENTS\nCAR OWNERSHIP\nCAR CARE\nINSURANCE\nSELL YOUR CAR\nBUY ASSURED CARS\nUsed Cars in Delhi NCR\nUsed Cars in Delhi\nUsed Cars in Gurgaon\nUsed Cars in Noida\nUsed Cars in Bangalore\nUsed Cars in Hyderabad\nUsed Cars in Mumbai\nUsed Cars in Pune\nUsed Cars in Chennai\nUsed Cars in Ahmedabad\nUsed Cars in Kolkata\nSpinny Car Hubs\nSearch\nNEWS\nBEST CARS\nBUYING A CAR\nCAR OWNERSHIP\nSELLING A CAR\nRULES & REGULATIONS\nNEWS\nBEST CARS\nBUYING A CAR\nCAR OWNERSHIP\nSELLING A CAR\nRULES & REGULATIONS\nHome\n\nBUYING A CAR\nMahindra XUV 3XO: Price, Specifications, Images\nExplore the Mahindra XUV 3XO, a feature-rich subcompact SUV with bold styling, 6 airbags, and a 5-star Bharat NCAP rating. This guide covers XUV 3XO price, specifications, safety features, and city-wise on-road pricing. Learn why it's a smart choice for families seeking a stylish, safe, and powerful urban SUV.\nTeam Spinny\nLast updated 3 months ago\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XO is the refreshed version of the immensely popular XUV300, marking the brands strong presence in this highly competitive sub-compact SUV segment. Known for its bold exterior design and premium interior with a large cabin, the XUV 3XO is the perfect combination of style, comfort, and functionality. With the legacy of Mahindra for quality and good sales, it is continuing to gain momentum among urban families and adventure lovers.\nThe 3XO also offers some amazing safety features and a fresh design, making it one of the class leaders in the subcompact SUV category. Its robust engineering and premium comfort make it unique among its competitors. Moreover, with a 5-star safety rating in the Bharat NCAP crash tests, the XUV 3XO promises to be a safe and agile car for families every time they drive it.\nMahindra XUV 3XO Overview\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XO charms with its aggressive looks, rich interiors, and big cabin space and sets a perfect blend of beauty and comfort with utilitarian value. The sharp LED headlamps, sleek grille, and muscular stance ensure it makes a strong first impression. Inside, the SUV provides a luxurious cabin with exclusive materials, ergonomic seating, and top-notch options for infotainment, assuring an immersive experience for occupants.\nThe XUV 3XO has a host of safety features, such as hill-start assist, electronic stability control, and up to six airbags to ensure driver and passenger safety. Its smooth driving dynamics, excellent manoeuvrability, and strong suspension system ensure a comfortable ride on city roads and rugged terrains. The XUV 3XO comes in various variants, like petrol and diesel, and automatic and manual transmissions to fit the bill for a wide range of customers.\nMahindra XUV 3XO Specifications\nThe XUV 3XO boasts of its unique design and the highest possible ratings for crash safety. Besides safety, here are the key Mahindra XUV 3XO Specifications:\nMahindra XUV 3XO Specifications\nEngine\n1.2L MPFi Turbo Petrol\n1.2L TGDi Turbo Petrol\n1.5L Diesel\nTransmission\n6-Speed Manual6-speed TC Automatic\n6-Speed ManualAMT Automatic\nPower\n110 PS\n130 PS\n117 PS\nTorque\n200 Nm\n230 Nm\n300 Nm\nMileage\n17.96 km/l\n18.20 km/l\n21.2 km/l\nAirbags\n6 Airbags as standard\nMahindra XUV 3XO Dimensions\nLength\n3990 mm\nWidth\n1821 mm\nHeight\n1647 mm\nWheelbase\n2600 mm\nBoot Space\n295 litres\nMahindra XUV 3XO Safety Features\nAirbags\n6 Standard\nABS with EBD\nStandard\nRear Parking Sensors\nStandard\nAll Wheel Disc Brakes\nStandard\nReverse Parking Camera\nHigher Variants\nElectronic Stability Programme\nStandard\nTyre Pressure Monitoring System\nHigher Variants\nISOFIX Mounts\nStandard\nHill Hold Assist\nStandard\nHill Descent Control\nStandard\nMahindra XUV 3XO Feature Highlights\nDual-Zone Automatic Climate Control\nAX5 and above\nSunroof\nAX7 and above\nFront Parking Sensors\nStandard\nMahindra XUV 3XO Price\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XO price offers great value for money, catering to various budgets. The price for the petrol variant of Mahindra XUV3XO starts at Rs. 7.99 lakh (ex-showroom) for the base MX1 model, and the diesel lineup begins at Rs. 9.90 lakh (ex-showroom). The top-end AX7L variant is priced at Rs. 15.56 lakh (ex-showroom), making it quite an all-rounded offering for buyers seeking premium features and safety. The price structure ensures a model to suit everyones needs, from budget-conscious buyers to those seeking a feature-packed SUV.\nMahindra XUV 3XO Price (ex-showroom)\nVariant\nPowertrain\nPrice\nXUV 3XO MX1\nPetrol\nRs. 7.99 lakh\nXUV 3XO MX2\nDiesel\nRs. 9.99 lakh\nXUV 3XO MX2 Pro\nPetrol\nRs. 9.39  10.39 lakh\nDiesel\nRs. 10.49 lakh\nXUV 3XO MX3\nPetrol\nRs. 9.74  11.40 lakh\nDiesel\nRs. 10.99  11.79 lakh\nXUV 3XO MX3 Pro\nPetrol\nRs. 9.99  11.69 lakh\nDiesel\nRs. 11.39 lakh\nXUV 3XO AX5\nPetrol\nRs. 11.19  12.69 lakh\nDiesel\nRs. 12.19  12.99 lakh\nXUV 3XO AX5 L\nPetrol\nRs. 12.44  13.94 lakh\nXUV 3XO AX7\nPetrol\nRs. 12.56 -13.99 lakh\nDiesel\nRs. 13.69  14.49 lakh\nXUV 3XO AX7 L\nPetrol\nRs. 13.99  15.56 lakh\nDiesel\nRs. 14.99 lakh\nMahindra XUV 3XO On-Road Price\nHeres a breakdown of the Mahindra XUV 3XO on-road in major cities in India:\nCity\nOn-Road Price\nDelhi\nRs. 8.97  18.20 lakh\nBangalore\nRs. 9.53  19.07 lakh\nHyderabad\nRs. 9.53  19.07 lakh\nMumbai\nRs. 9.35  18.37 lakh\nPune\nRs. 9.29  18.29 lakh\nAhmedabad\nRs. 9.07  17.68 lakh\nChennai\nRs. 9.65  19.52 lakh\nKolkata\nRs. 8.67  16.90 lakh\nLucknow\nRs. 9.04  17.96 lakh\nJaipur\nRs. 9.24  18.12 lakh\nChandigarh\nRs. 9.20  18.27 lakh\nCoimbatore\nRs. 9.44  19.21 lakh\nFaridabad\nRs. 9.04  17.65 lakh\nGhaziabad\nRs. 9.04  17.96 lakh\nIndore\nRs. 9.04  17.96 lakh\nKochi\nRs. 9.44  19.05 lakh\nSecond Hand Mahindra XUV 3XO Price\nThe second-hand car market offers many attractive options for budget-conscious buyers. Spinny offers used Mahindra XUV 3XO models with detailed inspections and comprehensive warranties. The price for a used Mahindra XUV 3XO depends on the model year, distance driven, variant, and mileage. Buying a secondhand XUV 3XO is an easy way to enjoy this feature-laden SUV at more affordable prices.\nUsed Mahindra XUV 3XO Price on Spinny\nSpinny is a trusted platform for second-hand car buyers and here is a list of XUV 3XO pricing across major cities:\nUsed Mahindra XUV 3XO price on Spinny\nCity\nUsed Car Price\nPune\nRs. 12 lakh onwards\nKolkata\nRs. 13 lakh onwards\nMahindra XUV 3XO Images\nMahindra XUV 3XO Exterior Images\nMahindra XUV 3XO Interior Images\nFAQs about Mahindra XUV 3XO\nQ. What is the price of XUV 3XO?\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XOs ex-showroom price starts at Rs. 7.79 lakh for the base model and goes up to Rs. 15.49 lakh for the top-end variant.\nQ. Is XUV 3XO 5-seater or 7-seater?\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XO is a 5-seater SUV that offers ample space and comfort for both front and rear passengers.\nQ. Is Mahindra XUV 3XO worth buying?\nYes, the XUV 3XO is worth buying due to its premium features, excellent safety ratings, spacious interiors, and a choice of powerful yet fuel-efficient engines. Its a complete package for small families and urban buyers.\nQ. Is Mahindra XUV 3XO launched in India?\nYes, the Mahindra XUV 3XO was officially launched in India on April 29, 2024.\nQ. Which XUV 3XO has a sunroof?\nThe sunroof option is available in several variants of the Mahindra XUV 3XO, including MX2 Pro 1.2 Petrol, MX3 1.2 Petrol, AX5 1.5 Diesel, AX7L 1.2 Petrol, and more. Sunroof availability varies depending on the specific variant and engine configuration.\nShare\nLeave a Comment\nCancel Reply\nYour email address will not be published.\nRequired fields are marked\n*\nType here..\nName*\nE-mail*\nWebsite\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment.\n\nUse Vehicle Transfer Form to Transfer Vehicle Ownership in Bangalore\nBest Used Jeep Cars\nJeep Compass Real World Mileage\nBest Used Volkswagen Cars in India: Top Picks and Buyer Tips\nUse Vehicle Transfer Form to Transfer Vehicle Ownership in Bangalore\nMarch 12, 2025\nBest Used Jeep Cars\nJuly 11, 2025\nJeep Compass Real World Mileage\nJuly 11, 2025\nBest Used Volkswagen", 'annotations': None}]}, {'url': 'https://www.carwale.com/mahindra-cars/xuv-3xo/', 'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': "[visible] Mahindra XUV 3XO Price - Images, Colours & Reviews - CarWale\nNEW CARS\nUSED CARS\nREVIEWS & NEWS\nAD\nMahindra XUV 3XO\n3.9\nExpert Rating\n|\n4.6\nUser Rating (553)\nRate & Win\nThe Mahindra XUV 3XO offers a sorted ride and engaging drive, ample space, and modern-day equipment. While its boot space is limited, it isn't a deal-breaker, especially considering the compact SUVs attractive pricing. It is available with both petrol and diesel power.\nOverview\n360 View\nVariants\nOffers\nSimilar Cars\nColours\nBrochure\nMileage\nUser Reviews\nNews\nExpert Reviews\nVideos\nImages\nFAQs\nColours\nImages\nView\nVariant\nSelect Variant\nCity\nShow price in my city\nRs.  7.99 - 15.80 Lakh\nXUV 3XO On Road Price\nEx-Showroom price, Mumbai\nCalculate your EMI\nEMI Calculator\nGet July Offers\n4 Things to Know About XUV 3XO\nHas projector headlamps, 17-inch alloys and a 360-degree camera.\nThe instrument cluster is fully digital with customisable screens.\nTop-spec versions get dual-zone climate control with rear AC vents.\nOne of the USPs of the Mahindra XUV 3XO is level-2 ADAS\nMahindra XUV 3XO Price\nMahindra XUV 3XO price for the base model starts at Rs. 7.99 Lakh and the top model price goes upto Rs. 15.80 Lakh (Avg. ex-showroom). XUV 3XO price for 29 variants is listed below.\nFilter By Fuel type & Transmission\nPetrol\nDiesel\nManual\nAutomatic (TC)\nAutomatic (AMT)\nVariants\nEx-Showroom price\nCompare\nXUV 3XO MX1 1.2 Petrol\n1197 cc, Petrol, Manual, 18.89 kmpl, 110 bhp\nRs. 7.99 Lakh\nCompare\nView Price Breakup\nGet Offers\nJust Launched\nXUV 3XO REVX M 1.2 Petrol\n1197 cc, Petrol, Manual, 110 bhp\nRs. 8.94 Lakh\nCompare\nView Price Breakup\nGet Offers\nJust Launched\nXUV 3XO REVX M (O)1.2 Petrol\n1197 cc, Petrol, Manual, 110 bhp\nRs. 9.44 Lakh\nCompare\nView Price Breakup\nGet Offers\nXUV 3XO MX2 Pro 1.2 Petrol\n1197 cc, Petrol, Manual, 18.89 kmpl, 110 bhp\nRs. 9.54 Lakh\nCompare\nView Price Breakup\nGet Offers\nXUV 3XO MX3 1.2 Petrol\n1197 cc, Petrol, Manual, 18.89 kmpl, 110 bhp\nRs. 9.74 Lakh\nCompare\nView Price Breakup\nGet Offers\nXUV 3XO MX3 Pro 1.2 Petrol\n1197 cc, Petrol, Manual, 18.89 kmpl, 110 bhp\nRs. 9.99 Lakh\nCompare\nView Price Breakup\nGet Offers\nXUV 3XO MX2 1.5 Diesel\n1497 cc, Diesel, Manual, 20.6 kmpl, 115 bhp\nRs. 9.99 Lakh\nCompare\nView Price Breakup\nGet Offers\nXUV 3XO MX2 Pro 1.2 Petrol AT\n1197 cc, Petrol, Automatic (TC), 17.96 kmpl, 110 bhp\nRs. 10.54 Lakh\nCompare\nView Price Breakup\nGet Offer